      "translation" : "[箭筒工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Quiver Maker",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mora villagers ask what good quivers are. They just don't know how the world works.",
      "translation" : "莫拉村民竟然问好箭筒有什么用。他们根本不懂这个世界。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Quiver Maker",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No wonder they don't know a thing about quivers - spreading jam over leaves all day long.",
      "translation" : "难怪他们不懂箭筒——整天只顾着把果酱涂在叶子上。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Quiver Maker",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please make me a quiver.",
      "translation" : "请给我做一个箭筒。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Quiver Maker",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What's a quiver?",
      "translation" : "箭筒是什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Quiver Maker",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Quiver Maker]",
      "translation" : "[箭筒工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Quiver Maker",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Finally, someone has appeared who knows the true value of a quiver. I will do it for those who know its worth.",
      "translation" : "终于来了个懂箭筒真正价值的人。我只为识货的人制作。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Quiver Maker",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Quiver Maker]",
      "translation" : "[箭筒工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Quiver Maker",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "At last someone appreciates a quiver!",
